📚 SQL Practice Dataset

A beginner-friendly SQL practice dataset designed to help learners improve their SQL skills through hands-on practice. This repository includes a sample employee database with realistic data and common SQL operations, making it ideal for learning and practicing SQL queries.

📌 What's Included
Employee table with sample records
CREATE TABLE statements
INSERT queries
ALTER TABLE examples
UPDATE queries
Ready-to-use SQL script
Beginner-friendly dataset
🎯 Perfect For Practicing
SELECT statements
WHERE clause
ORDER BY
GROUP BY
HAVING
JOINS
Aggregate Functions
String Functions
Date Functions
ALTER TABLE
UPDATE & DELETE
UNION
Subqueries
Basic SQL interview questions
🚀 How to Use
Clone this repository.
Open your preferred SQL database (MySQL recommended).
Import or run the abhay.sql file.
Start practicing SQL queries.
💻 Requirements
MySQL Server
MySQL Workbench (Recommended) or any SQL client
